  "description": "Pango-class text layout for CodeBrix.Platform apps, with no XAML and no application host required. Shapes text with HarfBuzz, resolves bidirectional runs per UAX #9, itemises across fallback fonts, and reports the geometry an editor or renderer needs: measured size, caret rectangles, cluster-correct hit-testing, per-line metrics, selection rectangles, and per-glyph or combined outline paths for filled and stroked text. Draws into any SKCanvas - an offscreen surface, a document layer, a bitmap. This is a facade over the very same engine that lays out every TextBlock in the framework, so there is exactly one text implementation in the family.",
  "iconFile": "icon-codebrix-128.png",
